</section>

<section class="ph-section">
  <div class="ph-wrap" style="display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:5rem;">

    <!-- Service 01 -->
    <article class="ph-split" id="landscaping">
      <div class="ph-gold-frame"><img src="{{ page.template_assets }}/images/landscaping-villa.jpg" alt="Landscaping design and installation" loading="lazy" style="width:100%; aspect-ratio:4/3; object-fit:cover; border-radius:1rem;"></div>
      <div>
        <span class="ph-eyebrow">Service 01</span>
        <h2 class="ph-sec-title" style="margin-block-start:0.8rem;">Landscaping Design &amp; Installation</h2>
        <p class="ph-copy" style="margin-block-start:1.2rem;">From concept to planting — villas, compounds and public spaces.</p>
        <p class="ph-copy" style="margin-block-start:1rem;">Our design team turns plans into living landscapes: concept and planting design, softscape and hardscape installation, irrigation networks, lighting and large-specimen palm transplanting. We deliver for developers, contractors, hotels and government entities.</p>
        <ul class="ph-check-list">
          <li>Concept &amp; planting design</li>
          <li>Irrigation &amp; lighting</li>
          <li>Specimen palm transplanting</li>
        </ul>
        <div class="ph-actions-row">
          <a class="ph-btn" href="/contact">Contact us</a>
          <a class="ph-btn ph-btn-outline" href="/projects">See our projects</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>

    <!-- Service 02 -->
    <article class="ph-split ph-split-reverse" id="maintenance">
      <div class="ph-gold-frame"><img src="{{ page.template_assets }}/images/grounds-maintenance.jpg" alt="Grounds maintenance" loading="lazy" style="width:100%; aspect-ratio:4/3; object-fit:cover; border-radius:1rem;"></div>
      <div>
        <span class="ph-eyebrow">Service 02</span>
        <h2 class="ph-sec-title" style="margin-block-start:0.8rem;">Grounds Maintenance</h2>
        <p class="ph-copy" style="margin-block-start:1.2rem;">Scheduled care that keeps landscapes healthy all year.</p>
        <p class="ph-copy" style="margin-block-start:1rem;">Trained crews provide pruning, palm trimming, fertilization, pest control, irrigation checks and lawn care on flexible annual contracts — with clear reporting for facility managers.</p>
        <ul class="ph-check-list">
          <li>Annual maintenance contracts</li>
          <li>Palm trimming &amp; pest control</li>
          <li>Irrigation audits</li>
        </ul>
        <div class="ph-actions-row">
